			<dict>
				<key>WFCommentActionText</key>
				<string>Log-PageShot: a URL in, a screenshot of it committed to shortcuts/shots/ in web-tools-private.

Can run as URL:
shortcuts://run-shortcut?name=Log-PageShot&amp;input=text&amp;text=&lt;the page URL&gt;

Two legs, one tap, one image. Leg 1 raises the page in the Show Web View sheet over Shortcuts; leg 2 opens the same page in Safari. Whether the run continues behind the sheet or resumes only when the sheet is dismissed is unmeasured (docs/shortcuts-format-notes.md asserts the first), so the second leg is the insurance: the two shots arrive side by side and the image says which route rendered the page.</string>
